WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.904 --> 00:00:03.059
- [Narrator] In the whacky
world of infomercials

00:00:03.059 --> 00:00:05.463
there is one man that
is the most famous face

00:00:05.463 --> 00:00:06.782
in the industry.

00:00:06.782 --> 00:00:08.638
- It's OxiClean.

00:00:08.638 --> 00:00:11.163
It gets the tough stains out.

00:00:11.163 --> 00:00:11.996
Kaboom!

00:00:13.022 --> 00:00:14.424
This is the Turbo Scrub.

00:00:14.424 --> 00:00:17.029
The rechargeable Cordless Power Scrubber.

00:00:17.029 --> 00:00:20.264
Then of course, there's the
incredible Sticky Buddy.

00:00:20.264 --> 00:00:24.431
It's slippy when it's wet,
and it's sticky when it's dry.

00:00:29.141 --> 00:00:32.356
Hi, Anthony Sullivan here,
for the Sticky Buddy.

00:00:32.356 --> 00:00:34.723
I am a pitchman by trade.

00:00:34.723 --> 00:00:35.963
Look at that.

00:00:35.963 --> 00:00:38.600
It cuts right through
this soft skin tomato.

00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:41.143
I'm so excited, I'm getting out of breath.

00:00:41.143 --> 00:00:44.406
A pitchman just excels at being able

00:00:44.406 --> 00:00:46.588
to sell certain products.

00:00:46.588 --> 00:00:49.571
Where is the OxiClean shirt?

00:00:49.571 --> 00:00:52.328
This is the magic shirt.

00:00:52.328 --> 00:00:54.307
It's like putting on Superman's cape.

00:00:54.307 --> 00:00:57.347
OxiClean gets the tough stains out.

00:00:57.347 --> 00:00:59.308
Is there anything in my teeth?

00:00:59.308 --> 00:01:00.391
- Looks good.

00:01:03.262 --> 00:01:06.321
- I started off selling when
I was 22 at a street market

00:01:06.321 --> 00:01:08.599
in England, and one day,
I turned on the television

00:01:08.599 --> 00:01:11.044
and I saw my first infomercial,
and a lightbulb went off

00:01:11.044 --> 00:01:13.857
in my head. And I thought, "I
need to get in front of

00:01:13.857 --> 00:01:15.985
"the TV camera and get off the street."

00:01:15.985 --> 00:01:18.696
- [Camera Man] And put it down.

00:01:18.696 --> 00:01:20.733
- You missed a spot.

00:01:20.733 --> 00:01:23.156
Some of the products that
we've sold over the years are

00:01:23.156 --> 00:01:27.008
the Swivel Sweeper, the Turbo
Scrub, the Sticky Buddy,

00:01:27.008 --> 00:01:31.509
OxiClean, Orange Glo, this
Hurricane Spin Mop, Clever Cam.

00:01:31.509 --> 00:01:33.648
The list is endless.

00:01:33.648 --> 00:01:35.656
It has quad brush technology.

00:01:35.656 --> 00:01:38.450
Forwards, backwards, or side
to side, and the worst part is

00:01:38.450 --> 00:01:40.208
we didn't charge the batteries.

00:01:40.208 --> 00:01:42.296
I think one of the most common
questions I ever get asked

00:01:42.296 --> 00:01:44.130
is does it really work
as good as it works?

00:01:44.130 --> 00:01:46.194
Which I think is one of
the reasons why people

00:01:46.194 --> 00:01:48.305
are attracted to "As Seen
on TV", 'cause you're like,

00:01:48.305 --> 00:01:50.251
"You gotta see this product.
Do you see what it does?

00:01:50.251 --> 00:01:51.426
It does everything".

00:01:51.426 --> 00:01:52.918
Clean the toilet, or clean your car.

00:01:52.918 --> 00:01:53.949
It'll clean your washing machine.

00:01:53.949 --> 00:01:55.269
It'll clean your floors.

00:01:55.269 --> 00:01:56.766
It'll clean this, clean that.

00:01:56.766 --> 00:02:00.151
I love it when I can do a "Wow
demo" that people sit at home

00:02:00.151 --> 00:02:01.706
and go, "Oh my God.

00:02:01.706 --> 00:02:03.229
"Look at that. Really works".

00:02:03.229 --> 00:02:04.484
It's the power of air.

00:02:04.484 --> 00:02:06.088
It's been a struggle.

00:02:06.088 --> 00:02:08.088
I haven't had the wind
behind me the whole way.

00:02:08.088 --> 00:02:09.589
But, um, it's been an amazing journey

00:02:09.589 --> 00:02:11.871
and I continue to really,
really enjoy what I do.

00:02:11.871 --> 00:02:14.121
I'm never doing that again.

